  [3334]={summary="Farmer's Shovel (#3334); published acquisition references: Tirisfal Farmer — Tirisfal Glades; Farmer Solliden — Tirisfal Glades; Stepping Stones quest #79192 choice, minimum 14 (live unverified; non-exhaustive).",confidence="published-forever-equipment-source-reference",url="https://www.wowhead.com/forever/item=3334/farmers-shovel",equipmentReference=true,details="Tirisfal Farmer (NPC #1934), Tirisfal Glades. Published map footprint: Tirisfal Glades x 34.4–39.5, y 49.2–53.1. Reference ranges, not a central waypoint/current sighting. Published item-to-NPC loot reference only. NPC rank, a name shared with the item, reaction or encounter membership is not used to infer a boss, rare status, hostility, targetability or guaranteed drop.\nFarmer Solliden (NPC #1936), Tirisfal Glades. Published map footprint: Tirisfal Glades x 34.4–38, y 49.4–51.9. Reference ranges, not a central waypoint/current sighting. Published item-to-NPC loot reference only. NPC rank, a name shared with the item, reaction or encounter membership is not used to infer a boss, rare status, hostility, targetability or guaranteed drop.\nSeparate published quest alternative: Stepping Stones #79192, minimum level 14, gives a choice of Farmer's Shovel #3334 or Mining Pick #2901; the quest minimum 14 is not the gear equip level 5 and does not erase the two published Tirisfal drop leads. Exact reward choices/minimum independently checked against the same-day quest page reused from Checkpoint 7B. Alliance starts #79008 at Westfall remains #415107, then Barrens remains/plank #415106/#417072; Horde starts #79007 at Barrens remains #415106, then Westfall remains/plank #415107/#424010. Both continue Stepping Stones to Pocket Litter #424005 at Stonetalon camp x40.7–40.8/y52.4–52.6, where the shovel is a selectable reward. Scramble is the next step, not a prerequisite for this shovel reward. Current initial triggers, phasing and full chain access remain unverified; no faction route or object ID copied between variants.\nAll new source directions are publication references, not independent live acquisitions. Exact current loot, spawn/targetability, quest/phase/faction access and stock remain unverified. No source table is assumed exhaustive; no drop rate, guaranteed item, optimal farm or availability is invented. Existing item identity, original source/confidence, equip/class rules, recipe ingredients, filters/settings and stronger manual/observed information remain intact."},
