  [5000]={summary="Coral Band (#5000): published identity; named acquisition origin still unresolved (current availability unverified).",confidence="published-forever-equipment-origin-unresolved",url="https://www.wowhead.com/forever/item=5000/coral-band",equipmentReference=true,details="Exact item page identifies this item but supplies no named enemy, vendor, quest, container/object or fishing route. Secondary item-ID/name-locked Playfulls/Classic checks and the configured three-install community observation feed did not establish an exact named origin for this version. A name resemblance, model match, outfit, related item, inferred boss rank or existence in client data is not acquisition proof. No guessed source, price, rate, minimum access or farm. Missing sources are not proof of impossibility.\nThe bind-on-equip tooltip supports a derived trading possibility for unbound copies, if any exist; current Auction House/player stock, price and the original acquisition route remain unverified. This is not evidence of a current vendor or drop.\nAll new source directions are publication references, not independent live acquisitions. Exact current loot, spawn/targetability, quest/phase/faction access and stock remain unverified. No source table is assumed exhaustive; no drop rate, guaranteed item, optimal farm or availability is invented. Existing item identity, original source/confidence, equip/class rules, recipe ingredients, filters/settings and stronger manual/observed information remain intact."},
  [5008]={summary="Origin unresolved: Quicksilver Ring exact ID; no supported named route (current availability unverified).",confidence="published-forever-equipment-origin-unresolved",url="https://www.wowhead.com/forever/item=5008",equipmentReference=true,details="Exact Forever item page has no named acquisition table. Independent Playfulls/Everloot selected-case checks and exact-name/ID discovery searches yielded no reliable current route. Datamined presence, same-name different-ID pages, client values, empty AH scans and reused Classic/retail tables do not establish current loot. No guessed source, seller, quest, boss, rate, unavailability flag or pin.\n\nName-collision safeguard: same-name random-suffix Classic items use different IDs (for example Quicksilver Ring #11991 versus this #5008, Ivory Band #11995 versus #7497, Vermilion Band #11992 versus #7466, Giant Club #15226 versus #16792). No source/observation or rate is transferred across those identities. Prismstone price mirror explicitly describes retail source data and lacks a realm AH scan; that is not current Forever loot confirmation.\n\nExact equipment tooltip gates/limits: Requires Level 31. These source annotations never rewrite original equip/class eligibility.\n\nAll routes are publication research, not personally observed live acquisition. Existing source/primary confidence, identity, stats, equip/class gates, settings and filters remain unchanged except the separately evidenced Centaur Hoofwarmers crafting-source/material correction. Original recipes/material lists are preserved. Current source/stock/spawn/phase/retention and complete-chain uncertainties remain explicit."},
