  [5541]={summary="Plans: Iridescent Hammer (#5543), Blacksmithing 115; broad published book-drop table; location examples: Alterac Mountains, Arathi Highlands, Ashenvale; more named enemies/locations in Guide (live unverified; non-exhaustive references).",confidence="published-forever-book-drop-reference",url="https://www.wowhead.com/forever/item=5543",patternID=5543,recipeReference=true,details="Published recipe-book drop references; may retain historical data. No confirmed live drop, drop-rate claim or recommended fastest farm. The retrieved table is a publication reference, not proof that its listed sources are exhaustive. These are sources for the learnable book, not finished crafted gear.\nAlterac Mountains: Rot Hide Plague Weaver, Syndicate Footpad, Cave Yeti, Ferocious Yeti, Dalaran Shield Guard, Mana Phantom, Fallen Warrior.\nArathi Highlands: Dabyrie Laborer, Syndicate Highwayman, Hammerfall Peon, Dark Iron Bombardier.\nAshenvale: Dark Strand Adept, Xavian Rogue, Forsaken Assassin, Befouled Water Elemental, Thistlefur Den Watcher, Thistlefur Pathfinder, Dal Bloodclaw, Fallenroot Rogue.\nBadlands: Shadowforge Digger.\nBlackfathom Deeps: Fallenroot Shadowstalker, Fallenroot Hellcaller, Blackfathom Sea Witch, Blackfathom Myrmidon, Twilight Acolyte, Twilight Reaver, Twilight Aquamancer, Twilight Shadowmage, Murkshallow Snapclaw, Blindlight Murloc, Barbed Crustacean, Aku'mai Snapjaw, Ghamoo-ra.\nDarkshore: Blackwood Shaman, Twilight Thug.\nDesolace: Hatefury Trickster, Hatefury Felsworn, Hatefury Hellcaller.\nDuskwood: Skeletal Warrior, Skeletal Horror, Nightbane Vile Fang, Skeletal Fiend, Brain Eater, Plague Spreader, Skeletal Healer, Nightbane Tainted One.\nElwynn Forest: Tarantula.\nExcavation Site: Wetlands: Thicket Lurker, Highland Lurker.\nGnomeregan: Caverndeep Burrower, Caverndeep Ambusher, Dark Iron Agent, Irradiated Slime, Leprous Technician, Leprous Defender, Mechano-Flamewalker, Mechanized Sentry, Holdout Warrior, Leprous Assistant.\nHillsbrad Foothills: Syndicate Shadow Mage, Cave Yeti, Ferocious Yeti, Hillsbrad Farmer, Hillsbrad Peasant, Hillsbrad Miner, Dalaran Shield Guard, Dun Garok Mountaineer, Forest Moss Creeper, Vicious Gray Bear, Hillsbrad Farmhand, Daggerspine Screamer, Torn Fin Oracle, Starving Mountain Lion, Feral Mountain Lion, Hillsbrad Foreman.\nLoch Modan: Mo'grosh Ogre, Mo'grosh Brute, Shadowforge Digger.\nRazorfen Downs: Withered Quilguard, Withered Battle Boar, Tomb Fiend.\nRazorfen Kraul: Razorfen Totemic, Razorfen Defender, Raging Agam'ar, Death's Head Acolyte, Death's Head Priest, Razorfen Groundshaker, Razorfen Beast Trainer, Razorfen Beastmaster, Kraul Bat, Quilguard Champion, Razorfen Stalker.\nRedridge Mountains: Blackrock Champion, Blackrock Renegade, Tarantula, Great Goretusk, Blackrock Sentry, Blackrock Hunter, Blackrock Summoner.\nRuins of Lordaeron: Spider, Skeleton, Shrieking Banshee, Ragged Ghoul, Ghoul, Stone Watcher, Plague Ghoul, Venom Lurker.\nScarlet Monastery: Scarlet Sentry, Scarlet Soldier, Scarlet Gallant, Scarlet Diviner, Scarlet Scryer, Scarlet Adept, Scarlet Chaplain, Scarlet Tracking Hound, Scarlet Torturer, Unfettered Spirit, Scarlet Monk, Haunting Phantasm, Scarlet Trainee.\nShadowfang Keep: Son of Arugal, Shadowfang Glutton, Shadowfang Ragetooth, Slavering Worg, Lupine Horror, Tormented Officer, Haunted Servitor, Wailing Guardsman.\nSilverpine Forest: Rot Hide Plague Weaver, Rot Hide Savage, Ravenclaw Drudger.\nStonetalon Mountains: Windshear Geomancer, Pridewing Consort, Bloodfury Slayer, Bloodfury Windcaller, Bloodfury Storm Witch, Mirkfallon Keeper.\nStranglethorn Vale: Young Stranglethorn Tiger, Young Panther, Kurzen Commando.\nThe Barrens: Greater Thunderhawk, Bael'dun Excavator, General Twinbraid, Nak, Kuz, Razormane Stalker, Razormane Warfrenzy.\nThe Deadmines: Defias Miner, Goblin Engineer, Sneed's Shredder, Defias Pirate, Defias Watchman, Goblin Craftsman.\nThe Stockade: Dextren Ward, Defias Prisoner, Defias Captive, Defias Inmate, Defias Convict, Defias Insurgent, Hamhock.\nThousand Needles: Galak Wrangler, Galak Scout, Galak Windchaser, Galak Marauder, Screeching Harpy, Screeching Roguefeather, Galak Flame Guard, Grimtotem Geomancer.\nUnresolved location (source ID -3): Defias Knuckleduster, Undead Dynamiter, Defias Watchman, Irradiated Invader.\nUnresolved location (source ID -6): Fallenroot Rogue.\nWailing Caverns: Deviate Ravager, Deviate Guardian, Evolving Ectoplasm, Druid of the Fang, Deviate Adder, Deviate Venomwing, Deviate Moccasin, Nightmare Ectoplasm.\nWestfall: Defias Knuckleduster, Riverpaw Mystic, Great Goretusk, Undead Dynamiter.\nWetlands: Mosshide Gnoll, Mosshide Mongrel, Highland Razormaw, Mottled Raptor, Mottled Razormaw, Crimson Ooze, Dragonmaw Raider, Dark Iron Dwarf, Dark Iron Tunneler, Leech Stalker, Cave Stalker, Dark Iron Bombardier, Highland Lurker.\nPublished container alternatives: Heavy Bronze Lockbox (#4633). Container contents, opening/access requirements and current availability remain unverified; not a guaranteed reward.\nNo named vendor/quest alternative is established by these exact pages; absence from a retrieved table does not prove one cannot exist. Mob levels and NPC ranks have not been used as gear eligibility or live-loot evidence."},
  [5596]={summary="Quest choice: Crown of the Earth #935 — Corithras Moonrage, Dolanaar → Fandral Staghelm, Darnassus (published; current eligibility/chain unverified).",confidence="published-forever-quest-equipment-reference",url="https://www.wowhead.com/forever/item=5596/ashwood-bow",equipmentReference=true,details="Final published reward step #935: take the provided Filled Vessel #5188 from Corithras Moonrage to Arch Druid Fandral Staghelm in the Cenarion Enclave, Darnassus, and choose Ashwood Bow (alternative Thicket Hammer). Corithras Moonrage (NPC #3515); published map footprint Teldrassil x 56.2–56.2, y 61.4–61.6. Arch Druid Fandral Staghelm (NPC #3516); published map footprint Darnassus x 34.4–34.8, y 8.4–8.8.\nPublished chain: Tenaron's Summons #920, Gilshalan Windwalker → Tenaron Stormgrip atop Aldrassil/Shadowglen; #921 fill the Crystal Phial at the moonwell north of Aldrassil and return to Tenaron; #928 deliver the Partially Filled Vessel to Corithras in Dolanaar; #929 fill the Jade Phial at Starbreeze Village's moonwell; #933 fill the Tourmaline Phial at Pools of Arlithrien southeast of Darnassus; #7383 fill the Amethyst Phial at Oracle Glade northwest; return to Corithras between water tasks, then #935 deliver the final vessel to Fandral. Gilshalan Windwalker (NPC #2082); published map footprint Teldrassil x 57.8–57.8, y 41.6–41.6. Tenaron Stormgrip (NPC #3514); published map footprint Teldrassil x 59–59, y 39.4–39.4. Source series also lists alternate #934 with no actors/Side None; do not treat it as a second active requirement. Published quest minimum 1 is not proof the complete chain is achievable at level 1. Full current prerequisites, phial interactions and availability unverified. Existing player-observed source and practical/equip gates remain primary.\nPublished quest/item evidence may retain historical or unobserved data. Minimum quest level is separate from item equip level, practical level, race/class wearability and full-chain availability. These research notes supplement existing observed/reported/manual sources without changing them; no current live acquisition confirmation."},
