  [6773]={summary="Quest reference: Khan Hratha #1380 (Both, minimum 30) / Khan Hratha #96222 (Both, minimum 35) (current eligibility/chain unverified).",confidence="published-forever-quest-equipment-reference",url="https://www.wowhead.com/forever/item=6773",equipmentReference=true,details="Choice reward: Khan Hratha #1380; published minimum 30, displayed quest level 42, side Both.\nStart: Uthek the Wise (npc #5397), Desolace 36.2,79.2 [independent NPC page lists this exact quest].\nEnd: Uthek the Wise (npc #5397), Desolace 36.2,79.2 [independent NPC page lists this exact quest].\nPublished objective: Maintain your reputation with the Gelkis, and bring the Maraudine Key Fragment to Uthek the Wise in the Gelkis Village. Maraudine Key Fragment ( 1 ) Gelkis Clan Centaur ( Friendly ) War Horn Mouthpiece ( 1 )\nObjective/provided item links: Maraudine Key Fragment #6077; War Horn Mouthpiece #6074. These are quest inputs, not drops of the finished equipment.\nPublished series links (not assumed all mandatory prerequisites): Khan Jehn #1374. All linked exact pages fetched; current branch/sequence availability unverified.\n\nChoice reward: Khan Hratha #96222; published minimum 35, displayed quest level 42, side Both.\nStart: Umarak (npc #253066), Desolace x43.4–43.6, y78.6–78.8 (published footprint, not one waypoint) [independent NPC page lists this exact quest].\nEnd: Umarak (npc #253066), Desolace x43.4–43.6, y78.6–78.8 (published footprint, not one waypoint) [independent NPC page lists this exact quest].\nPublished objective: Bring the Maraudine Key Fragment to Umarak in the Desolace . Maraudine Key Fragment ( 1 ) War Horn Mouthpiece ( 1 )\nObjective/provided item links: Maraudine Key Fragment #6077; War Horn Mouthpiece #6074. These are quest inputs, not drops of the finished equipment.\n\nSame-name Khan Hratha versions remain distinct: older #1380 (Uthek/Gelkis) or #1381 (Warug/Magram), minimum 30 with their own Friendly clan objective, versus #96222 (Umarak), minimum 35 and no published clan-standing objective. Do not require both rival clans or copy an older standing gate into #96222. Current active quest version/access remains unverified. Horn mouthpiece, summoned Khan and key fragment are quest-input directions, not finished-equipment drops.\n\nPublished quest data can retain historical or inaccessible scenarios. Minimum quest level, displayed quest level and gear equip/catalogue level are different. Reward choices are alternatives, not simultaneous rewards. Linked series may include follow-on or alternate branches; full current prerequisites/access remain unverified. Quest-objective enemies/objects yield inputs or progression, not assumed finished-gear drops. Existing primary source/confidence, item identity, class/equip eligibility, recipe/material lists, settings and filters remain unchanged; no live acquisition confirmation."},
