  [7001]={summary="Quest choice: Blackfathom Villainy #1200 Alliance / #6561 Horde — Argent Guard Thaelrid, Blackfathom Deeps; return to faction city (published; current eligibility unverified).",confidence="published-forever-quest-equipment-reference",url="https://www.wowhead.com/forever/item=7001/gravestone-scepter",equipmentReference=true,details="Published minimum level 18 for both variants. Start with Argent Guard Thaelrid NPC #4787 inside Blackfathom Deeps (precise dungeon pin unverified); defeat Twilight Lord Kelris for Head of Kelris #5881. The head page lists Kelris NPC versions #4832/#209678 in Blackfathom Deeps; these are quest-objective loot references, not drops of the scepter. Alliance #1200: return to Dawnwatcher Selgorm in Darnassus. Horde #6561: return to Bashana Runetotem in Thunder Bluff. Dawnwatcher Selgorm (NPC #4783); published map footprint Darnassus x 55.4–56, y 23.6–24.6. Bashana Runetotem (NPC #9087); published map footprint Thunder Bluff x 70.2–70.8, y 33–33.8. Choose Gravestone Scepter from four listed alternatives; Arctic Buckler, Dark Ritual Leggings and Cultist's Armguards are separate choices. Existing In Search of Thaelrid/player-observed instructions stay primary; the exact published reward is Blackfathom Villainy, not a guaranteed dungeon boss gear drop. Complete current prerequisite chain and live quest rewards unverified.\nPublished quest/item evidence may retain historical or unobserved data. Minimum quest level is separate from item equip level, practical level, race/class wearability and full-chain availability. These research notes supplement existing observed/reported/manual sources without changing them; no current live acquisition confirmation."},
