  [7915]={summary="Plans: Barbaric Iron Helm (#7980), Blacksmithing 150; quest references: Horde: Horns of Frenzy (#2754) from Orokk Omosh, Orgrimmar; published quest minimum level 32 (published; current availability/prerequisites unverified).",confidence="published-forever-quest-book-reference",url="https://www.wowhead.com/forever/item=7980/plans-barbaric-iron-helm",patternID=7980,recipeReference=true,details="Published recipe-book quest references (live availability and prerequisites unverified):\nHorns of Frenzy (#2754): start Orokk Omosh, Orgrimmar; turn in to Orokk Omosh, Orgrimmar. Published reward is this book; Horde. Published minimum quest level 32; this is separate from equipment level and book-learning skill. Published quest classes: Warrior, Hunter, Druid (verify access; gear eligibility unchanged). Deliver 2 Solid Iron Mauls, 2 Silvered Bronze Boots and 2 Silvered Bronze Gauntlets. Current quest availability and prerequisite chain remain unverified.\nRelated quest supply: Solid Iron Maul plans (#10858, crafted item #3851) have published sellers Jannos Ironwill in Arathi Highlands, Muuran in Desolace and Jazzrik in Badlands. Their stock/access remains unverified; these are supplies for the book quest, not extra ingredients added to the crafted helm."},
