  [8350]={summary="The 1 Ring (#8350); published acquisition references: fishing — Stormwind City, The Barrens, Thunder Bluff, Orgrimmar, Silverpine Forest, Darkshore, Undercity (live unverified; non-exhaustive).",confidence="published-forever-equipment-source-reference",url="https://www.wowhead.com/forever/item=8350/the-1-ring",equipmentReference=true,details="Exact item page lists published fishing references: Stormwind City (zone #1519), The Barrens (zone #17), Thunder Bluff (zone #1638), Orgrimmar (zone #1637), Silverpine Forest (zone #130), Darkshore (zone #148), Undercity (zone #1497). These are fishing catches, not NPC drops. Required fishing skill, exact water/pool, current loot/rates and completeness are unverified; gear equip level is not a fishing skill requirement.\nAdditional item-ID/name-matched Playfulls fishing location references: Westfall, Undercity, Stormwind City, Ironforge, Orgrimmar, Thunder Bluff, Darnassus, Dreadmist Peak, Southfury River, Southern Barrens, The Deadmines, Blackthorn Ridge. Separate community data may retain historical information; no exclusive location, fastest farm or catch chance claimed.\nAll new source directions are publication references, not independent live acquisitions. Exact current loot, spawn/targetability, quest/phase/faction access and stock remain unverified. No source table is assumed exhaustive; no drop rate, guaranteed item, optimal farm or availability is invented. Existing item identity, original source/confidence, equip/class rules, recipe ingredients, filters/settings and stronger manual/observed information remain intact."},
  [8708]={summary="Temporary weapon: Signet of Expertise summon, one-hour duration (current quest/access unverified).",confidence="published-forever-item-creation-reference",url="https://www.wowhead.com/forever/item=8708",equipmentReference=true,details="Summon Smithing Hammer #11209 is used by Signet of Expertise #8703 (Blacksmithing 185), itself the published Expert Blacksmith! #2765 direct reward, minimum 40, Galvan the Ancient #7802, Stranglethorn Vale x50.4–50.6, y20.4–20.6 (published footprint, not one waypoint). Exact quest quick facts list Warrior, Paladin, Hunter and Blacksmithing; these are quest-route restrictions, not a new Hammer equip/class mask. Hammer tooltip duration is ONE HOUR; Signet use cooldown is THREE HOURS, not a three-hour weapon. Full current quest prerequisites/access unverified. This is a summoned temporary weapon, not a learned permanent smithing recipe.\n\nExact equipment tooltip gates/limits: Duration: 1 hour; Requires Level 40. These source annotations never rewrite original equip/class eligibility.\n\nAll routes are publication research, not personally observed live acquisition. Existing source/primary confidence, identity, stats, equip/class gates, settings and filters remain unchanged except the separately evidenced Centaur Hoofwarmers crafting-source/material correction. Original recipes/material lists are preserved. Current source/stock/spawn/phase/retention and complete-chain uncertainties remain explicit."},
  [9366]={summary="Plans: Golden Scale Gauntlets (#9367), Blacksmithing 180; quest references: The Origins of Smithing (#2758), Alliance, minimum quest level 40; start Hank the Hammer (NPC 7798), Stormwind City (published; current access/prerequisites unverified).",confidence="published-forever-quest-book-reference",url="https://www.wowhead.com/forever/item=9367",patternID=9367,recipeReference=true,details="These references track recipe books; separate direct-gear rewards are noted when exact quest metadata lists them. No live acquisition confirmed.\nThe Origins of Smithing (#2758): start Hank the Hammer (NPC 7798), Stormwind City; turn in to Hank the Hammer (NPC 7798), Stormwind City. Published reward: this exact book; Alliance; minimum quest level 40 (separate from gear equip level and book learning skill). Hank the Hammer published map footprint: Stormwind City x 56–63, y 15.2–36.8. Quest metadata lists Warrior, Paladin; current quest-class access unverified. This is not applied to the gear catalogue or filters. Published quest delivery objectives: 6 x Golden Scale Bracers (#6040). These delivery costs are not the finished recipe ingredients. Current availability, prerequisites, specialisation access and completeness of the chain remain unverified. Map footprints are reference ranges, not current sightings or central waypoints."},
  [9372]={summary="Item-use assembly: Jang'thraze + Sang'thraze, Call of Sul'thraze #11654 (published; current input access/function unverified).",confidence="published-forever-item-creation-reference",url="https://www.wowhead.com/forever/item=9372",equipmentReference=true,details="Item-use assembly, not a learned profession recipe: Call of Sul'thraze #11654 lists output #9372 x1, Sang'thraze the Deflector #9379 x1 reagent, and use items Jang'thraze #9380 or same-name #11086. Exact #9380 tooltip also names combining the two swords. No skill/book/trainer teaching is shown; no Blacksmithing, recipe ingredients or class eligibility added to the catalogue from this conversion. Exact consumption/retention and current functionality unverified.\nSang'thraze #9379 has a published Antu'sul #8127/Zul'Farrak relationship, independently matched in the NPC reverse list; this is the INPUT sword's source, not a finished Sul'thraze drop. The selected Jang'thraze #9380 has no exact origin; Chief Ukorz's loot lists the different #11086 version. No transfer between same-name IDs or implied guaranteed drop/current rate.\nExact published requirements: Requires Level 50. Quest minimum, gear equip level, purchase access and class masks stay distinct.\nAll routes live-unverified. Preserve stronger manual/reported/observed sources, exact identities/stats/class/equip eligibility, all existing crafts/ingredients and filter/settings/layout behavior. Reference counts or old beta reports do not imply current access, availability, probabilities, inventory or a guaranteed route."},
