  [13347]={summary="Quest-provided object: Crystal of Zin-Malor; not a final quest reward (current retention/access unverified).",confidence="published-forever-quest-provided-item-reference",url="https://www.wowhead.com/forever/item=13347",equipmentReference=true,details="Provided quest objective, not a final reward: Tormented By the Past #5248; published minimum 53, displayed quest level 58, side Alliance.\nStart: Aurora Skycaller (npc #10304), Eastern Plaguelands x53.4–53.6, y22–22 (published footprint, not one waypoint) [independent NPC page lists this exact quest].\nEnd: Remorseful Highborne (npc #10684), Winterspring x56–56.2, y43.4–44.6 (published footprint, not one waypoint) [independent NPC page lists this exact quest].\nPublished objective: Take the Crystal of Zin-Malor to Lake Kel'Theril in Winterspring and find a highborne spirit that will speak to you. Crystal of Zin-Malor (Provided) ( 1 )\nObjective/provided item links: Crystal of Zin-Malor #13347. These are quest inputs, not drops of the finished equipment.\nPublished series links (not assumed all mandatory prerequisites): Remorseful Highborne #5252; The Crystal of Zin-Malor #5253. All linked exact pages fetched; current branch/sequence availability unverified.\n\nProvided quest objective, not a final reward: Remorseful Highborne #5252; published minimum 53, displayed quest level 58, side Alliance.\nStart: Remorseful Highborne (npc #10684), Winterspring x56–56.2, y43.4–44.6 (published footprint, not one waypoint) [independent NPC page lists this exact quest].\nEnd: Wynd Nightchaser (npc #11079), Winterspring 52,30.2 [independent NPC page lists this exact quest].\nPublished objective: Speak with Wynd Nightchaser in Starfall Village, and ask about the proper place for the Crystal of Zin-Malor . Crystal of Zin-Malor (Provided) ( 1 )\nObjective/provided item links: Crystal of Zin-Malor #13347. These are quest inputs, not drops of the finished equipment.\nPublished series links (not assumed all mandatory prerequisites): Tormented By the Past #5248; The Crystal of Zin-Malor #5253. All linked exact pages fetched; current branch/sequence availability unverified.\n\nProvided quest objective, not a final reward: The Crystal of Zin-Malor #5253; published minimum 53, displayed quest level 58, side Alliance.\nStart: Wynd Nightchaser (npc #11079), Winterspring 52,30.2 [independent NPC page lists this exact quest].\nEnd: Arch Druid Fandral Staghelm (npc #3516), Darnassus x34.4–34.8, y8.4–8.8 (published footprint, not one waypoint) [independent NPC page lists this exact quest].\nPublished objective: Deliver the Crystal of Zin-Malor to Arch Druid Fandral Staghelm in Darnassus. Crystal of Zin-Malor (Provided) ( 1 )\nObjective/provided item links: Crystal of Zin-Malor #13347. These are quest inputs, not drops of the finished equipment.\nPublished series links (not assumed all mandatory prerequisites): Tormented By the Past #5248; Remorseful Highborne #5252. All linked exact pages fetched; current branch/sequence availability unverified.\n\nCrystal of Zin-Malor #13347 is a Quest Item, provided for #5248/#5252/#5253, each minimum 53. Catalogue level 1 is not an acquisition level. The exact tooltip warns it deals damage and drains 100 to 500 mana every second if not worthy. This is not a permanent low-level trinket reward or a recommendation to equip it. Current retention/consumption and effect behaviour unverified; catalogue identity/gates untouched.\n\nPublished quest data can retain historical or inaccessible scenarios. Minimum quest level, displayed quest level and gear equip/catalogue level are different. Reward choices are alternatives, not simultaneous rewards. Linked series may include follow-on or alternate branches; full current prerequisites/access remain unverified. Quest-objective enemies/objects yield inputs or progression, not assumed finished-gear drops. Existing primary source/confidence, item identity, class/equip eligibility, recipe/material lists, settings and filters remain unchanged; no live acquisition confirmation."},
