  [16769]={summary="Vendor reference: Gorn One Eye (published; current stock/access unverified).",confidence="published-forever-equipment-vendor-reference",url="https://www.wowhead.com/forever/item=16769",equipmentReference=true,details="Gorn One Eye (NPC #11555), Felwood x65.2–65.4, y2.4–2.6 (published footprint, not one waypoint): published inventory price 14g 9s 9c; no finite table stock shown; not a current-stock guarantee.\nExact published requirements: Requires Level 47. Equip level, purchase gate, class restriction and current access remain separate; canonical eligibility is unchanged.\nFurbolg Medicine Totem is this exact main-hand mace/equip47 record, not the similarly named other Medicine Pouch. Current tooltip has no explicit Timbermaw standing; inventory standing0 and reaction[-1,-1] do not establish Neutral/hostile sale or a particular access rank. Historical Classic Honored requirements must not be imported as current proof; purchase access unresolved.\nInventory standing0 is not proof of Neutral access; reaction flags are publication fields, not a verified access rule. Item-specific merchant prices can differ; no inferred honour/mark currency, rank, win count or discount formula. Finite stock is not current quantity or a respawn timer. Preserve stronger observed/manual sources, identity/stats/class/equip/recipe ingredients/settings/filter semantics. No personal live acquisition, drop probability or current-stock claim."},
  [16792]={summary="Origin unresolved: Giant Club exact ID; no supported named route (current availability unverified).",confidence="published-forever-equipment-origin-unresolved",url="https://www.wowhead.com/forever/item=16792",equipmentReference=true,details="Exact Forever item page has no named acquisition table. Independent Playfulls/Everloot selected-case checks and exact-name/ID discovery searches yielded no reliable current route. Datamined presence, same-name different-ID pages, client values, empty AH scans and reused Classic/retail tables do not establish current loot. No guessed source, seller, quest, boss, rate, unavailability flag or pin.\n\nName-collision safeguard: same-name random-suffix Classic items use different IDs (for example Quicksilver Ring #11991 versus this #5008, Ivory Band #11995 versus #7497, Vermilion Band #11992 versus #7466, Giant Club #15226 versus #16792). No source/observation or rate is transferred across those identities. Prismstone price mirror explicitly describes retail source data and lacks a realm AH scan; that is not current Forever loot confirmation.\n\nExact equipment tooltip gates/limits: Requires Level 32. These source annotations never rewrite original equip/class eligibility.\n\nAll routes are publication research, not personally observed live acquisition. Existing source/primary confidence, identity, stats, equip/class gates, settings and filters remain unchanged except the separately evidenced Centaur Hoofwarmers crafting-source/material correction. Original recipes/material lists are preserved. Current source/stock/spawn/phase/retention and complete-chain uncertainties remain explicit."},
