  [17193]={summary="Plans: Sulfuron Hammer (#18592), Blacksmithing 300; quest references: A Binding Contract (#7604), Both factions, minimum quest level 60; start use Thorium Brotherhood Contract (item #18628) (published; current access/prerequisites unverified).",confidence="published-forever-quest-book-reference",url="https://www.wowhead.com/forever/item=18592",patternID=18592,recipeReference=true,details="These references track recipe books; separate direct-gear rewards are noted when exact quest metadata lists them. No live acquisition confirmed.\nA Binding Contract (#7604): start use Thorium Brotherhood Contract (item #18628); turn in to Lokhtos Darkbargainer (NPC 12944), Blackrock Depths. Published reward: this exact book; Both factions; minimum quest level 60 (separate from gear equip level and book learning skill). Published quest delivery objectives: 1 x Thorium Brotherhood Contract (#18628), 1 x Sulfuron Ingot (#17203). These delivery costs are not the finished recipe ingredients. Starting item #18628 begins this exact quest; requires character level 60 according to its tooltip; acquisition/current access unverified. Current availability, prerequisites, specialisation access and completeness of the chain remain unverified. Map footprints are reference ranges, not current sightings or central waypoints."},
  [17223]={summary="Item-effect reference: transform Shadowstrike into Thunderstrike (current acquisition unverified).",confidence="published-forever-item-transformation-reference",url="https://www.wowhead.com/forever/item=17223",equipmentReference=true,details="The exact selected Thunderstrike #17223 page lists created-by Summon Thunderstrike #21180; the separately fetched spell is Item Effect/Transform Item and says Shadowstrike becomes Thunderstrike, with exact output #17223. The inverse Summon Shadowstrike #21181 is used by selected #17223 and points to output item #17074. This is a published item transformation, not profession teaching or an ordinary learned recipe. References: https://www.wowhead.com/forever/spell=21180 ; https://www.wowhead.com/forever/spell=21181\nSelected tooltip transforms back into Shadowstrike and shows a1-minute item-use cooldown; underlying spells show a10-second cast, distinct fields rather than confirmed current activation timing. Exact input #17074 primary item page returns404; inverse spell embeds an unnamed placeholder, so current input identity/version/availability/supply remain unconfirmed. Secondary Shadowstrike #17074 tooltip lists the transformation, but its Sulfuron Harbinger/Molten Core loot statement is explicitly Classic data, not current Forever input loot or selected Thunderstrike boss loot. https://foreverdb.net/item/17074\nSame-name Shadowstrike #288903 has different published level/binding and is not substituted as input. Current transformation/retention/acceptance are unverified; no new profession skill, ingredient requirement or inherited boss/faction route is established.\nExact published tooltip requirements: Requires Level 58. Equip/class requirements are distinct from current acquisition access; publication research is not a personal live observation.\nSecondary discovery context: https://www.turtle-wow.cn/item/17223/ ; https://bootybaybroker.com/it/forever/item/17223/thunderstrike"},
  [17562]={summary="Legacy rank/version mapping unresolved: Knight-Lieutenant's Dreadweave Boots (current acquisition unverified).",confidence="conflicting-pvp-requirement-reference-unresolved",url="https://www.wowhead.com/forever/item=17562",equipmentReference=true,details="Exact-ID secondary database publications state PvP rank7, while this fetched primary tooltip/equip block omits an explicit PvP rank requirement and has no acquisition table. This is an unresolved publication/version difference, not an accepted current rank gate or ungated-purchase claim.\nSecondary published merchant row names Captain Dirgehammer, Champions' Hall, with coin charge 4g36s83c and an unlimited-stock symbol. This is attributed legacy/version reference, not independently matched current inventory, accepted price, Honor cost, rank condition or stock guarantee. https://questcorehq.com/wowdb/forever/item/17562/knight-lieutenants-dreadweave-boots\nThe primary general Forever PvP guide says rare Honor gear needs no rank; it does not map this selected exact legacy ID to a current seller/currency/version or Premier replacement. Rank names, faction names, old client fields and Classic-derived vendor data do not resolve that mapping. No Honor/mark/seal amount, retirement, phase or upgrade output is established. Reused policy snapshot read9Nov2026: https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/pvp-overview-ranking-rewards\nDated access context: Blizzard’s5Nov known-issues thread, read9Nov2026, lists capital PvP vendors temporarily unavailable in Orgrimmar, Stormwind and Dalaran. This is not a fresh10Nov stock test, permanent retirement or a statement about every battleground/reputation merchant. Current acceptance remains unverified. https://us.forums.blizzard.com/en/wow/t/known-issues-wow-forever-updated-nov-5/2402363\nExact published tooltip requirements: Classes: Warlock; Requires Level 58. Equip/class requirements are distinct from current acquisition access; publication research is not a personal 