  [18957]={summary="Quest reference: Druid of the Claw #2561 (Alliance, minimum 3) (current eligibility/chain unverified).",confidence="published-forever-quest-equipment-reference",url="https://www.wowhead.com/forever/item=18957",equipmentReference=true,details="Choice reward: Druid of the Claw #2561; published minimum 3, displayed quest level 10, side Alliance.\nStart: Oben Rageclaw (npc #7317), Teldrassil x45–45, y61.4–61.6 (published footprint, not one waypoint) [independent NPC page lists this exact quest].\nEnd: Oben Rageclaw (npc #7317), Teldrassil x45–45, y61.4–61.6 (published footprint, not one waypoint) [independent NPC page lists this exact quest].\nPublished objective: Oben Rageclaw wants you to kill his soulless body, and then use the Voodoo Charm . Release Oben Rageclaw's spirit ( 1 ) Provided item: Voodoo Charm ( 1 )\nObjective/provided item links: Voodoo Charm #8149. These are quest inputs, not drops of the finished equipment.\nPublished series links (not assumed all mandatory prerequisites): The Sleeping Druid #2541. All linked exact pages fetched; current branch/sequence availability unverified.\n\nPublished quest data can retain historical or inaccessible scenarios. Minimum quest level, displayed quest level and gear equip/catalogue level are different. Reward choices are alternatives, not simultaneous rewards. Linked series may include follow-on or alternate branches; full current prerequisites/access remain unverified. Quest-objective enemies/objects yield inputs or progression, not assumed finished-gear drops. Existing primary source/confidence, item identity, class/equip eligibility, recipe/material lists, settings and filters remain unchanged; no live acquisition confirmation."},
  [19024]={summary="Quest reference: Arena Grandmaster #7838 (Both, minimum unknown) (current eligibility/chain unverified).",confidence="published-forever-quest-equipment-reference",url="https://www.wowhead.com/forever/item=19024",equipmentReference=true,details="Direct reward: Arena Grandmaster #7838; published minimum unknown, displayed quest level 55, side Both.\nStart: Short John Mithril (npc #14508), Stranglethorn Vale x29.4–31, y47.4–48.8 (published footprint, not one waypoint) [independent NPC page lists this exact quest].\nEnd: Short John Mithril (npc #14508), Stranglethorn Vale x29.4–31, y47.4–48.8 (published footprint, not one waypoint) [independent NPC page lists this exact quest].\nPublished objective: Progress Avast Lubber! Bring me 12 trinkets of the Arena Master and then ye shall be a Grandmaster of the Gurubashi Arena! Arrrr! Arena Master ( 12 ) Completion Much blood have you spilt on the Arena floor and I be glad to name you Grandmaster of the Arena! Rewards You will receive: Arena Grand Master See if you've already completed this by typing: /run print(C_QuestLog.IsQuestFlaggedCompleted(7838))\n\nArena Grandmaster #7838 asks for 12 Arena Master #18706 trinkets; not 12 Grand Master items, arena kills or guaranteed wins. Its quick facts say Required level ?? and its record omits reqlevel; quest minimum remains unknown. Gear equip level 50 and displayed quest level 55 are separate. Initial Arena Master #7810 has minimum 1, but this is not proof Grandmaster #7838 also does. Alternate #7908 has no faction/giver data; do not treat it as a required additional turn-in. Exact item/object/container checks list Arena Master inside Arena Treasure Chest #179697 and Arena Spoils #277534, itself listed in that chest. Published chest footprint Stranglethorn Vale x30.4–30.5,y47.8 is a reference; no current contents, guaranteed trinket, event schedule, respawn interval or acquisition time inferred. Grandmaster page labels Repeatable, not independently live-verified.\n\nPublished quest data can retain historical or inaccessible scenarios. Minimum quest level, displayed quest level and gear equip/catalogue level are different. Reward choices are alternatives, not simultaneous rewards. Linked series may include follow-on or alternate branches; full current prerequisites/access remain unverified. Quest-objective enemies/objects yield inputs or progression, not assumed finished-gear drops. Existing primary source/confidence, item identity, class/equip eligibility, recipe/material lists, settings and filters remain unchanged; no live acquisition confirmation."},
