ings required for a single sale. The general Honor/upgrade policy does not automatically replace every reputation-specific reference with a guessed currency or rank. Distinct level tiers, seller prices and item IDs remain separate; current enforcement/charges/phase are unverified.\nExact published tooltip/individual inventory requirements: Classes: Priest , Mage , Warlock; Requires Level 60; Requires Stormpike Guard - Exalted; Requires Frostwolf Clan - Exalted. Equip level and class requirements are distinct from current purchase access.\nLocations are published footprints, not sightings. Merchants with no usable map remain unpinned; broad location fields do not prove simultaneous spawns. Current stock, currency/discount, phase/faction/rank acceptance, restock and reputation earning rates remain unverified. References are not a guaranteed live acquisition route."},
