  [217270]={summary="Pattern #217271 for Turtle Scale Gloves #217270: exact published book page flags unavailable to players; learning route unresolved (live unverified). Distinct from normal gloves #8187/book #8385.",confidence="published-forever-availability-conflict",url="https://www.wowhead.com/forever/item=217271",recipeReference=true,details="The exact book page flags unavailable and lacks a teaches-recipe table, despite tooltip spell 439118. Imported vendor claims are not reliable purchase instructions for this version. Preserve gear #217270 and its original eligibility/material facts. Normal Turtle Scale Gloves #8187 use a different book (#8385) and spell (10509); their supported published vendor/drop references must not be copied onto this version or erased by its warning."},
  [217273]={summary="Golden Scale Gauntlets version #217273/book #217274: exact published book page flags unavailable to players; current learning route unresolved (live unverified). Normal gloves #9366/book #9367 are distinct.",confidence="published-forever-availability-conflict",url="https://www.wowhead.com/forever/item=217274",recipeReference=true,details="The exact book page flags unavailable and lacks a teaches-recipe table. Its tooltip names spell 439120, whose page creates gear 217273 but supplies only a see-also link to the different normal recipe 11643/gear 9366, not a confirmed teaching route. Preserve the version-specific catalogue/class/material facts; do not add a required book ID or copy the normal quest reward onto it. The normal Golden Scale Gauntlets #9366 retain book #9367 and their separately researched Origins of Smithing quest route."},
  [217314]={summary="Quest choice: Scramble #79980 — Pocket Litter → Mound of Dirt, Stonetalon Mountains; minimum 14 (published; current chain access unverified).",confidence="published-forever-quest-equipment-reference",url="https://www.wowhead.com/forever/item=217314/moonsight-rifle",equipmentReference=true,details="Choose Moonsight Rifle (exact gear #217314) from Scramble's three listed weapon choices: Silver Star #3463, Moonsight Rifle #217314 or Precision Bow #217315. This exact version is a quest reward, not a recipe or a drop of the finished weapon from a named enemy. Published object route: Pocket Litter #424005 at abandoned camp, Stonetalon x 40.7–40.8/y 52.4–52.6; travel north to Mound of Dirt #424012 at 39.6,49.9 to complete Scramble. Both are interactive objects, not NPCs.\nPrerequisite route published on the quest pages: Alliance starts ...and that note you found #79008 at Westfall Burned-Out Remains #415107 (37.4–37.5,50.6–50.7), then visits The Barrens remains #415106 and Nailed Plank #417072 (46.4,73.8). Horde starts #79007 at The Barrens remains #415106 (46.4,73.9), then visits Westfall remains #415107 and Nailed Plank #424010 (37.4–37.5,50.8–50.9). Both continue Stepping Stones #79192 to Pocket Litter, which starts Scramble. Faction variants and object IDs kept distinct. Later sleeping-bag chain stages are not prerequisites for this weapon reward. The linked guide/commentary contains conflicting descriptions of initial triggers; current phasing and prerequisites remain unverified. Published map points are reference locations, not live sightings. No time-saving death/ghost route or guaranteed chain availability is asserted.\nPublished quest/item evidence may retain historical or unobserved data. Minimum quest level is separate from item equip level, practical level, race/class wearability and full-chain availability. These research notes supplement existing observed/reported/manual sources without changing them; no current live acquisition confirmation."},
