  [217497]={summary="Mage item conversion: Scroll of the Blade + Hypnotic Blade (current scroll source unverified).",confidence="published-forever-item-creation-reference",url="https://www.wowhead.com/forever/item=217497",equipmentReference=true,details="Exact spell/output join: Imbue Blade #440236 creates Narpas Sword #217497; published listed inputs Hypnotic Blade #7714 x1.\n\nExact spell/output join: Imbue Blade #1302286 creates Narpas Sword #217497; published listed inputs Hypnotic Blade #7714 x1.\n\nCurrent item-effect Imbue Blade #1302286 is used by Scroll of the Blade #217496 with one Hypnotic Blade #7714. Exact Scroll and Narpas Sword tooltips explicitly restrict Mage; sword equip level 34/BoP is separate. Old spell #440236 lists the same output but is not a second verified current route. Scroll origin remains unresolved (no named acquisition table); no invented trainer/vendor/library drop. Hypnotic Blade's exact item page lists Arcanist Doan; current drop unverified. This item-use conversion is not ordinary Blacksmithing.\n\nExact equipment tooltip gates/limits: Classes: Mage; Requires Level 34. These source annotations never rewrite original equip/class eligibility.\n\nAll routes are publication research, not personally observed live acquisition. Existing source/primary confidence, identity, stats, equip/class gates, settings and filters remain unchanged except the separately evidenced Centaur Hoofwarmers crafting-source/material correction. Original recipes/material lists are preserved. Current source/stock/spawn/phase/retention and complete-chain uncertainties remain explicit."},
  [219345]={summary="Quest reward: Brought to Heel #81919, Bloodmage Lynnore; minimum45/equip50 (published; current chain/access unverified).",confidence="published-forever-quest-equipment-reference",url="https://www.wowhead.com/forever/item=219345",equipmentReference=true,details="Permanent trinket #219345 is a direct reward from Brought to Heel #81919, quest minimum45/display54/Elite; gear equip50 remains separate. IMPORTANT: same-name PROVIDED quest tool is Infernal Lasso #220216, itemlevel1/Quest Item, with a 30-second Calefactus weakening effect. It is not permanent trinket #219345 (equip50, five-minute combat-effect cooldown). Do not claim reward219345 is provided, import the tool cooldown, or promise retention/re-use of the quest tool.\nPublished chain: The Burning Beast #81900 starts at Weathered Etching object #441061, Searing Gorge x14.4–14.5, y36.3–36.5 (published footprint, not one waypoint), then ends at Bloodmage Lynnore #7506, Blasted Lands x50.4–50.6, y14.2–14.6 (published footprint, not one waypoint). Chains That Bind #81917 requires five Infernal Chain Links #220214; six exact item-page/NPC reverse drop joins identify Shadowsworn Cultist6004, Thug6005, Adept6006, Enforcer6007, Warlock6008 and Dreadweaver6009, all independently identified in Blasted Lands. Brought to Heel #81919 requires one Fel Lifeblood #220213 from Calefactus the Unleashed #221740; independent reverse loot lists Lifeblood, not the finished Lasso. Final tool is used to weaken Calefactus; no class restriction or Warlock profession inferred.\nQuest pages encode Lynnore start/end for81917/81919, but the independently fetched NPC quest lists omit both later quests and confirm only the earlier81900 end. Keep this reverse-list discrepancy; do not silently claim all actors independently joined. All three quests have unconfirmed environment status/Side None, which does not establish either faction acceptance or current phasing/access. Quest text says Calefactus current location unknown; mapper has a broad Blasted Lands footprint, not one live waypoint. Full chain prerequisites/current spawn/party needs/tool retention remain unverified.\nExact published requirements: Requires Level 50. Quest minimum, gear equip level, purchase access and class masks stay distinct.\nAll routes live-unverified. Preserve stronger manual/reported/observed sources, exact identities/stats/class/equip eligibility, all existing crafts/ingredients and filter/settings/layout behavior. Reference counts or old beta reports do not imply current access, availability, probabilities, inventory or a guaranteed route."},
