  [252565]={summary="Pattern: Mender's Mail Boots (#252899), Leatherworking 200; published book-drop leads: Scarlet Monastery: Arcanist Doan (NPC 6487); Razorfen Downs: Mordresh Fire Eye (NPC 7357) (published; live unverified; non-exhaustive).",confidence="published-forever-book-drop-reference",url="https://www.wowhead.com/forever/item=252899",patternID=252899,recipeReference=true,details="Published book-source research. These sources concern the learnable recipe book, not drops of finished crafted gear. No current rate, exclusive source, fastest farm, guaranteed spawn/reward or live acquisition claim. Retrieved tables are not established as exhaustive. Tables can retain historical data.\nRazorfen Downs: Mordresh Fire Eye (NPC 7357).\nScarlet Monastery: Arcanist Doan (NPC 6487).\nNo vendor/quest route is established by these exact book tables; absence is not proof none exists. Quest, book-learning and equip gates remain separate; NPC rank is not current loot proof."},
  [252566]={summary="Pattern: Stalker's Mail Shoulders (#252900), Leatherworking 210; 60 Merchant's Favor; published sellers: Alliance Daniel Stitchsong, Three Corners, Redridge Mountains; Horde Pawani, west of Crossroads, The Barrens. Tooltip: Friendly with this faction (live stock/gates unverified).",confidence="published-forever-recipe-vendor-reference",url="https://www.wowhead.com/forever/item=252900",patternID=252900,recipeReference=true,details="Exact book tooltip: Leatherworking 210 to learn; requires Friendly with this faction, without naming the faction. Camp guides identify Azeroth Commerce Authority for Alliance and Durotar Supply and Logistics for Horde; this is published context, not an independently confirmed current book-specific faction gate. No gate is inferred from cost or a similar pattern.\nAlliance seller: Daniel Stitchsong (NPC 256734), Three Corners, western Redridge Mountains. Horde seller: Pawani (NPC 248201), outside the west gate of the Crossroads in The Barrens. Both exact item tables list 60 Merchant's Favor (currency 3402). Stock quantity, current inventory and access remain unverified.\nPublished currency route: fill a Waylaid Crate with one requested material bundle; take the sealed crate to Marcy Baker at Three Corners (Alliance) or Dokimi outside the west gate of the Crossroads (Horde) for Merchant's Favor. Reputation is a separate requirement: the guide describes Craftsman's Writs, crafting the requested item and delivering it to the named customer. Consult the current crate/writ and vendor for requirements and rewards; no fixed grind, turn-in count or live availability is established."},
