  [271800]={summary="Quest reference: Khan Jehn #93196 (unspecified side, minimum 35) (current eligibility/chain unverified).",confidence="published-forever-quest-equipment-reference",url="https://www.wowhead.com/forever/item=271800",equipmentReference=true,details="Choice reward: Khan Jehn #93196; published minimum 35, displayed quest level 42, side unspecified side.\nPublished objective: Maintain your reputation with the Magram and perform a necromancy ritual to resurrect Khan Jehn. The ritual site can be found in a tent at the central lake of Magram Village. Khan Jehn resurrected ( 1 ) Magram Clan Centaur ( Honored ) Provided item: Ultimate Necromancy Staff ( 1 )\nObjective/provided item links: Ultimate Necromancy Staff #257517. These are quest inputs, not drops of the finished equipment.\nPublished series links (not assumed all mandatory prerequisites): Brutal Politics #1385; Magram Alliance #1367; Assault on the Kolkar #1386; Broken Tears #1369; A Conqueror's Crown #92743; Valley of Bones #92841; Mountain of Bones #92844; Outcast Necromancers #92846; Corrupting Tears #92847; Proof of Concept #92873; No Mercy for the Weak #92893; Bone Raising #92894; Bristleback Retreat #93066; Long-Term Solutions #93072; Threat of Starvation #93129; Return to Orgrul #93188. All linked exact pages fetched; current branch/sequence availability unverified.\n\nKhan Jehn #93196 is a resurrection ritual choice reward, not a kill-drop: narrative describes Orgrul and a tent at the central lake of Magram Village, requiring Magram Honored and a provided Ultimate Necromancy Staff. The exact page says Side None, has no actor/giver/turn-in data and no mapper. No exact Orgrul NPC ID, pin or current faction access inferred from narrative or previous-chain actors. Current giver/phase/availability remains unresolved.\n\nPublished quest data can retain historical or inaccessible scenarios. Minimum quest level, displayed quest level and gear equip/catalogue level are different. Reward choices are alternatives, not simultaneous rewards. Linked series may include follow-on or alternate branches; full current prerequisites/access remain unverified. Quest-objective enemies/objects yield inputs or progression, not assumed finished-gear drops. Existing primary source/confidence, item identity, class/equip eligibility, recipe/material lists, settings and filters remain unchanged; no live acquisition confirmation."},
