  [273884]={summary="Pattern: Grovekeeper Trousers (#273952), Leatherworking 300; Aisarra Nightmeadow — Mount Hyjal; listed 8 x Malleable Essence of Nature. Published gate: Friendly Guardians of Hyjal + completion of Friendly Advice (live stock/access unverified).",confidence="published-forever-recipe-vendor-reference",url="https://www.wowhead.com/forever/item=273952/pattern-grovekeeper-trousers",patternID=273952,recipeReference=true,details="Published recipe-book vendor reference, not sale of the finished crafted gear. Aisarra Nightmeadow (NPC #264797), Mount Hyjal; published map point 71.0,51.2 is a reference, not a current sighting. Exact book sold-by table and independently fetched merchant inventory both contain this same book ID and listed item-currency cost. Current faction access, vendor presence, price and stock quantity remain unverified; stock -1 is not proof of unlimited availability. The older community source's anonymous row is not a second merchant.\nExact book tooltip lists Friendly Guardians of Hyjal and completion of Friendly Advice. A reliable exact quest ID, giver, objectives and full prerequisite chain were not established in this research; no guessed quest pin or alternate similarly named quest is supplied.\nPublished book purchase cost: 8 x Malleable Essence of Nature #274030. Purchase cost and quest/slot gates are separate from the finished-gear ingredient list and equip requirements. Learning skill 300 comes from this exact book; existing craft difficulty/skill and materials are unchanged.\nPublished reagent tooltip lead: Malleable Essence of Nature #274030 is described as obtained by disenchanting items from Hyjal Summit or Barrow Deeps. This is tooltip text, not an independently observed live disenchant table; exact item yields, quantities, profession skill/access and current availability remain unverified. No guaranteed yield, rate or specific boss farm is inferred."},
