  [277254]={summary="Quest reference: Greater Friend of the Library #82208 (Both, minimum 35) (current eligibility/chain unverified).",confidence="published-forever-quest-equipment-reference",url="https://www.wowhead.com/forever/item=277254",equipmentReference=true,details="Choice reward: Greater Friend of the Library #82208; published minimum 35, displayed quest level 45, side Both.\nStart: Garion Wendell (npc #211033), Stormwind City x37.6–49, y80.2–86.6 (published footprint, not one waypoint) [independent NPC page lists this exact quest].\nEnd: Garion Wendell (npc #211033), Stormwind City x37.6–49, y80.2–86.6 (published footprint, not one waypoint) [independent NPC page lists this exact quest].\nEnd: Owen Thadd (npc #211022), Undercity x73.2–73.8, y32.2–33.6 (published footprint, not one waypoint) [independent NPC page lists this exact quest].\n\nPublished Forever Library Book Locations and Rewards guide maps 25 donated books to exact quest #82208 and these three choice rewards; 20 books belongs to different quest #79536, despite the shared Greater Friend of the Library title. Guide explicitly allows all classes to collect and donate books; existing item wearability remains separate; no obsolete Mage-only rune gate. Quest minimum 35, item equip 40 and the 25-book requirement are separate. Independent actor inventories list Garion Wendell #211033 as start/end in Stormwind and Owen Thadd #211022 as Horde end in Undercity. Owen's checked inventory does not list #82208 as a start; do not silently turn an end-only relationship into a verified Horde acceptance route. Current donation tracking, unique-book counting, full chain and Horde acceptance remain unverified; no specific book-collection route guaranteed.\n\nPublished quest data can retain historical or inaccessible scenarios. Minimum quest level, displayed quest level and gear equip/catalogue level are different. Reward choices are alternatives, not simultaneous rewards. Linked series may include follow-on or alternate branches; full current prerequisites/access remain unverified. Quest-objective enemies/objects yield inputs or progression, not assumed finished-gear drops. Existing primary source/confidence, item identity, class/equip eligibility, recipe/material lists, settings and filters remain unchanged; no live acquisition confirmation."},
