  [277672]={summary="Plans: Rough Copper Chain Boots (#277673), Blacksmithing 50; quest references: Alliance: The Quarry's Smith (#95217) from Frast Dokner, Dun Morogh; published quest minimum level 7 / Horde: This Is Spinal Axe (#96874) from Ug'thok, Orgrimmar; published quest minimum level 6 (published; current availability/prerequisites unverified).",confidence="published-forever-quest-book-reference",url="https://www.wowhead.com/forever/item=277673/plans-rough-copper-chain-boots",patternID=277673,recipeReference=true,details="Published recipe-book quest references (live availability and prerequisites unverified):\nThe Quarry's Smith (#95217): start Frast Dokner, Dun Morogh; turn in to Frast Dokner, Dun Morogh. Published reward is this book; Alliance. Published minimum quest level 7; this is separate from equipment level and book-learning skill. Published quest classes: Warrior, Paladin, Shaman (verify access; gear eligibility unchanged). Published race restriction present; exact character access needs confirmation (not applied to gear eligibility). Deliver 12 Copper Bars and 4 Toughened Boar Hides. Current quest availability and prerequisite chain remain unverified.\nThis Is Spinal Axe (#96874): start Ug'thok, Orgrimmar; turn in to Ug'thok, Orgrimmar. Published reward is this book; Horde. Published minimum quest level 6; this is separate from equipment level and book-learning skill. Published quest classes: Warrior, Paladin, Shaman (verify access; gear eligibility unchanged). Collect 5 Weathered Spines from beasts in Thunder Ridge and bring 5 Rough Grinding Stones. Current quest availability and prerequisite chain remain unverified."},
