  [279898]={summary="Quest reference: Important Heirlooms #96403 (Alliance, minimum 10) (current eligibility/chain unverified).",confidence="published-forever-quest-equipment-reference",url="https://www.wowhead.com/forever/item=279898",equipmentReference=true,details="Choice reward: Important Heirlooms #96403; published minimum 10, displayed quest level 15, side Alliance.\nStart: Thom Filch (npc #265003), Ironforge x31.4–32.6, y44.4–45.8 (published footprint, not one waypoint) [independent NPC page lists this exact quest].\nEnd: Thom Filch (npc #265003), Ironforge x31.4–32.6, y44.4–45.8 (published footprint, not one waypoint) [independent NPC page lists this exact quest].\nPublished objective: Collect 8 Dwarven Heirlooms from the Hall of Thanes . Dwarven Heirloom ( 8 )\nObjective/provided item links: Dwarven Heirlooms #274289; Dwarven Heirloom #274289. These are quest inputs, not drops of the finished equipment.\n\nPublished quest data can retain historical or inaccessible scenarios. Minimum quest level, displayed quest level and gear equip/catalogue level are different. Reward choices are alternatives, not simultaneous rewards. Linked series may include follow-on or alternate branches; full current prerequisites/access remain unverified. Quest-objective enemies/objects yield inputs or progression, not assumed finished-gear drops. Existing primary source/confidence, item identity, class/equip eligibility, recipe/material lists, settings and filters remain unchanged; no live acquisition confirmation."},
  [280304]={summary="Invisible Dagger (#280304): published identity; named acquisition origin still unresolved (current availability unverified).",confidence="published-forever-equipment-origin-unresolved",url="https://www.wowhead.com/forever/item=280304/invisible-dagger",equipmentReference=true,details="Exact item page identifies this item but supplies no named enemy, vendor, quest, container/object or fishing route. Secondary item-ID/name-locked Playfulls/Classic checks and the configured three-install community observation feed did not establish an exact named origin for this version. A name resemblance, model match, outfit, related item, inferred boss rank or existence in client data is not acquisition proof. No guessed source, price, rate, minimum access or farm. Missing sources are not proof of impossibility.\nAll new source directions are publication references, not independent live acquisitions. Exact current loot, spawn/targetability, quest/phase/faction access and stock remain unverified. No source table is assumed exhaustive; no drop rate, guaranteed item, optimal farm or availability is invented. Existing item identity, original source/confidence, equip/class rules, recipe ingredients, filters/settings and stronger manual/observed information remain intact."},
  [280306]={summary="Schematic: Whimsical Waistwrap (#280321): Engineering 175; vendor references: Alliance Fritz Fizzle, Three Corners, Redridge Mountains; Horde Fizzlefuse, near Crossroads, The Barrens; 180 Merchant's Favor (published listings; live stock/gates unverified). Published requirement: Friendly reputation (Alliance: Azeroth Commerce Authority; Horde: Durotar Supply and Logistics; published faction gates, live access unverified).",confidence="published-forever-recipe-vendor-reference",url="https://www.wowhead.com/forever/item=280321/schematic-whimsical-waistwrap",patternID=280321,recipeReference=true,details="The exact schematic tooltip requires Friendly but does not name its faction. The published Fritz Fizzle inventory specifies Azeroth Commerce Authority. The independently read Fizzlefuse guide explicitly links this exact schematic ID/name to Friendly Durotar Supply and Logistics; this supplements the Alliance guide. Both remain published references, not live purchase verification.\nPublished currency route: fill a Waylaid Crate with one requested material bundle; take the sealed crate to Marcy Baker at Three Corners (Alliance) or Dokimi outside the west gate of the Crossroads (Horde) for Merchant's Favor. Reputation is a separate requirement: the guide describes Craftsman's Writs, crafting the requested item and delivering it to the named customer. Consult the current crate/writ and vendor for requirements and rewards; no fixed grind, turn-in count or live availability is established."},
