  [281267]={summary="Quest reward: Bloodtalon Matriarch #97223 — Xar'Ti, Sen'jin Village, Durotar; minimum 5 (published; current eligibility unverified).",confidence="published-forever-quest-equipment-reference",url="https://www.wowhead.com/forever/item=281267/raptorscale-pants",equipmentReference=true,details="Published Horde quest: Xar'Ti (NPC #7953); published map footprint Durotar x 55.2–55.2, y 75.4–75.6. Defeat Bloodtalon Matriarch #268530 on the islands off Durotar, collect one Bloodtalon Matriarch Eggs #277128 and return to Xar'Ti in Sen'jin Village. Exact eggs item page lists the matriarch, whose own drop table independently includes those eggs. Published matriarch map footprint Durotar x 66.8–68.8/y 70.2–72.7; reference spawn area, not a current sighting or single guaranteed pin. Raptorscale Pants #281267 are listed as the direct quest reward, not a drop of pants from the matriarch. Current encounter, egg loot, full prerequisites and quest availability remain unverified; no rate or guaranteed spawn is asserted.\nPublished quest/item evidence may retain historical or unobserved data. Minimum quest level is separate from item equip level, practical level, race/class wearability and full-chain availability. These research notes supplement existing observed/reported/manual sources without changing them; no current live acquisition confirmation."},
